cad-agent is licensed under the MIT license (LICENSE), except for what is listed below. This file
says which parts are MIT and which are not, which files derive from FreeCAD, and which third-party
components the repository ships. The full licence texts those components ask to be kept are in
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES. The files derived from FreeCAD also carry their own notice in their header.

FreeCAD (https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD) is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License, version 2 or superior (its CONTRIBUTING.md, section 4). Every FreeCAD file named here is
cited at commit 3160daf1e2b62b0472854da4848255c6b3ad554c, and its copyright lines are quoted from
that commit.


